flowchart TB
  accTitle: Stalwart on Vertex
  accDescr: Three edges and three mail replicas share PostgreSQL durable state and Redis coordination.
  Internet["SMTP, submission<br/>IMAP, JMAP"]
  Edge["3 HAProxy edges<br/>IPv4 + IPv6, PROXY v2"]:::edge
  App["3 Stalwart replicas<br/>on distinct nodes"]
  SQL["PostgreSQL, 3 instances<br/>Accounts, mail, blobs<br/>Search, delivery queue<br/>Synchronous replication"]:::durable
  Redis["Redis + Sentinel, 3<br/>Counters, locks<br/>Coordinator pub/sub<br/>Asynchronous replication"]:::transient
  Internet --> Edge --> App
  App -->|"TLS"| SQL
  App <-.->|"coordination"| Redis
  classDef edge fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#e84d60,color:#172033
  classDef durable fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#172033
  classDef transient fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#172033
